{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_012_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:445e7f0361bc445626b99463f05467b0db9924fe870d7d38d7166c7ab30486fc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ddb7017ff1c859090ebf36ee04e6eff7c01508608837d2ffe4b3f74ba9f5043",
      "text": "太好啦～！是情人节巧克力～！ 嘿嘿，谢啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5314dd98e2df49fdfc5435f8467ba389a4e80dfd1e425ba9e3467cca3bcdcfb2",
      "text": "其实我一直期待着，能不能收到 ●●●●●●●●●●监督送的巧克力呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c38c84ad10b72a2d0ba32bda01be413dffe41d8d83701026c1e919148b9aef6",
      "text": "哇～这个巧克力看起来超级好吃！ 呐，我可以吃吗？可以的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6953d93242ec3fe363c7e9075c7bee63ef5245f13e4d3f50bf1ccc9fa32e84e6",
      "text": "我开动啦—— ……嗯～真好吃！一下子充满元气了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7d703d23c13e76e59e86838d38e073665ffbbc040ab69ca4d5781c8acb44b9d",
      "text": "好——接下来的工作也要加油咯～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b595bdfb25d10412e632fcec5a4dbc34785d3894e3637e0a6faf2865e626d1b3",
      "text": "欸，这个巧克力是给我的吗？ 哇哇，真的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50a6fccd511bc8b42c6baf6ea16c6032c1cb2302515b0df9afe94b03a3fc46c5",
      "text": "我原本还在想要是能收到就好了， 吓了我一跳呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eecd62d90b5d3edb76ccb232755c7c347880cf4a843ecba7c838c5366f0a1e91",
      "text": "谢啦，●●●●●●●●●●监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:297fcb2a6d53114a5c5e141a5ec15c0c28a1f2899062e67d1bf02bccb832682a",
      "text": "那我就开动啦——！ 嗯～这个巧克力超级好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a547bfca1e09c4ba20ef8a21a57365e62d4c8615df677a4d8f7ac2422d9c6e95",
      "text": "虽然很想全部吃完……嗯—— 现在还是先吃到这里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19c1f30fbd1899cf3d46ddd4148b0c26320fc29411ce7c6901bd1cbdcc71dd3d",
      "text": "毕竟是监督特意送我的， 一口气全吃完太可惜了嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b1c9a6da179cb39c442e2559fe7f6a941523686be953400380802a15986c7a4",
      "text": "……嗯！ 剩下的就留到回家之后再吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:326b6cc16051b4d24a24bb66b733ab27e90e2be15e0800791596fb8420d8bce5",
      "text": "监督，谢谢你送我这么好吃的巧克力！ 白色情人节我会回礼的，等着我哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000058:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a386eb374f663d888b84b860f25d9b6bb5ade841c9197725eb4b86db60d95ac8",
      "text": "我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000059:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23adc085765c3e9492556857d96c8c3387c5d73aafbf3d796cffc4c594864889",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我会为了●●●●●●●●●●监督 准备最棒的礼物的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_22:5_01_012_22_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23adc085765c3e9492556857d96c8c3387c5d73aafbf3d796cffc4c594864889",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我会为了●●●●●●●●●●监督 准备最棒的礼物的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
